  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Jealousy Provokers is a popular channel run by Yu-Min Sun and Geon-Woo Ma. Clients reach out when they need help figuring out their crushes' feelings, and Yu-Min or Geon-Woo play the part of a potential love interest to gauge whether the feelings are mutual. Woo-Ri Goh's a huge fan of the show, so when she lands a job as the new manager, she couldn't be happier! But she soon realizes that seeing someone on screen is a lot different than knowing them in real life...\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n *Note: Includes three side stories and one epilogue chapter.*",
